This project contains Swift ports of the image-generation pipelines in MFLUX. The ports follow MFLUX's
implementation (operation order, dtype flow and weight layouts) and are checked against it for parity.
MFLUX's licence notice is reproduced below.

The model architectures were created by their authors, whose reference implementations are:

- FLUX.2 by Black Forest Labs, https://github.com/black-forest-labs/flux2 (Apache License 2.0)
- Z-Image by Tongyi-MAI (Alibaba), https://github.com/Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image (Apache License 2.0)

This project builds on MLX Swift (https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-swift, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023
ml-explore), resolved as a SwiftPM dependency and not included in this repository.

No model weights are included. Each model's weights are covered by their own licence; see the model cards.

